Error [E0112]: `plan` wants Int (a whole number) for argument 2, but this is String (text)
  --> tests/ui/default_arg_type_mismatch.jet:4:26
    |
  4 |     print(plan("Lisbon", "three"))
    |                          ^^^^^^^
 Why: Every argument must match its parameter's type
 Fix: Use Int (a whole number) here
